, "quote_verified": true, "quotes": ["The algorithm used in the analysis, the combined secondary vertex (Version 2), is described in Ref. [ 42 ] .", "The analysis uses a 'medium' operating point, which corresponds to approximately 10 (60)% tagging efficiencies for $\\mathup{{{c}}}$ ( $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ ) quark jets and a misidentification probability of 1% for a light jet."], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "The paper uses the combined secondary vertex (Version 2) algorithm with the 'medium' working point. This provides 10% tagging efficiency for c-jets, 60% for b-jets, and a 1% misidentification probability for light jets.", "section": "Object reconstruction and event selection", "window": 1, "escalated": false, "raw": "{\"reasoning\": \"The text mentions the b-tagging algorithm (combined secondary vertex Version 2), the working point (medium), and performance metrics (tagging efficiencies for c and b jets, and misidentification probability for light jets).\", \"quotes\": [\"The algorithm used in the analysis, the combined secondary vertex (Version 2), is described in Ref. [ 42 ] .\", \"The analysis uses a 'medium' operating point, which corresponds to approximately 10 (60)% tagging efficiencies for $\\\\mathup{{{c}}}$ ( $\\\\mathup{{{b}}}$ ) quark jets and a misidentification probability of 1% for a light jet.\"], \"answer\": \"The paper uses the combined secondary vertex (Version 2) algorithm with the 'medium' working point. This provides 10% tagging efficiency for c-jets, 60% for b-jets, and a 1% misidentification probability for light jets.\", \"found\": true}"}, {"paper_id": "2001.06899", "qid": "gf-11", "answer": true, "quote": "The algorithm used in the analysis, the combined secondary vertex (Version 2), is described in Ref. [ 42 ] .", "quote_verified": true, "quotes": ["The algorithm used in the analysis, the combined secondary vertex (Version 2), is described in Ref. [ 42 ] .", "The analysis uses a 'medium' operating point, which corresponds to approximate